# ── Secrets and credentials ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deliberately explicit. Nothing sensitive has ever been committed here (634
# commits scanned before this repo went public: no .env, no key material, no
# credentials), and these patterns are what keeps that true.
#
# Real configuration lives in the .env file on the deploy host and in GitHub
# environment secrets. Neither belongs in git.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_ed25519

# ── Python (tooling that runs alongside this repo) ────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
coverage.xml
.coverage
